                      <SD SI="Monitor_Enable_Conditions" TI="TI_1347374842">1.EC-1:Ignition Status                                                                   2.EC-2 Local Voltage                                                              3.EC-3 Bus Physical status                                                      4.EC-4 Debounce Timer 
