                      <SD SI="Cause_of_Failure" TI="TI_103430773">1.Protocol fault                                                                                                                                  2.HW defect                                                                                                                                                     3.Internal voltages out of tolerance                                                                                        4.SW bugs                                                                                                                                          5.Clock error                                                                                                                                                6.Storage (Memory ) error</SD>
